#. Translators: what kind of program skwir is, shown under its name.
#: org.skwir.skwir.desktop:5
#, fuzzy
msgid "File Manager"
msgstr "Gestionnaire de fichiers"

#: org.skwir.skwir.desktop:6 org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:11
#, fuzzy
msgid "Browse, find and organize your files"
msgstr "Parcourir, retrouver et organiser vos fichiers"

#. Translators: the words a launcher's search finds skwir by, each followed
#. by a semicolon, with no space around it. Write those people search with
#. in your language; they need not be the English words one for one.
#: org.skwir.skwir.desktop:17
#, fuzzy
msgid "files;folders;browser;tags;search;"
msgstr "fichiers;dossiers;explorateur;étiquettes;recherche;"

#. Translators: who makes skwir, as software centres say it.
#: org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:9
#, fuzzy
msgid "The skwir authors"
msgstr "Les auteurs de Skwir"

#: org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:13
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Skwir is an augmented file manager, built to be driven by humans and agents "
"alike."
msgstr ""
"Skwir est un gestionnaire de fichiers augmenté, conçu pour être piloté aussi "
"bien par des humains que par des agents."

#: org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:18
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lists, grids and columns that stay responsive on very large folders"
msgstr ""
"Listes, grilles et colonnes qui restent réactives dans de très grands "
"dossiers"

#: org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:19
#, fuzzy
msgid "Previews of documents, pictures, music, films, archives and maps"
msgstr ""
"Aperçus de documents, d’images, de musique, de films, d’archives et de cartes"

#: org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:20
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tags kept on the files themselves, where other applications find them"
msgstr ""
"Étiquettes conservées sur les fichiers eux-mêmes, là où les autres "
"applications les trouvent"

#: org.skwir.skwir.metainfo.xml:21
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every change undoable, and planned for review before it is applied"
msgstr ""
"Chaque modification annulable, et présentée dans un plan à examiner avant "
"d’être appliquée"
